Insurance Premium Calculator 🚗🏥💼

A simple Python mini project that calculates the annual insurance premium based on customer age, policy type, and claim history.

📌 Project Overview

This project helps insurance companies estimate the final premium amount for customers using predefined business rules.

The program takes customer details as input and applies premium adjustments based on:

Age category
Policy type
Number of claims
